         1.  mongodb
              1.  Ownership
              2.  Results and the driver
              3.  Servers and errors
              4.  Connections
              5.  Commands
              6.  Documents
              7.  Cursors and change streams
              8.  Databases
              9.  Collections, views and indexes
              10. Transactions
              11. Settings
              12. GridFS
              13. Maintenance
    4.  Swapping
2.  COST
    ----
    1.  Sizes and moves
*/

